<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Pharma Transport Enterprise</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Enterprise GPS tracking for pharma cold chain. FDA 21 CFR Part 11. $99/mo per vehicle.">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { 
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, sans-serif; 
      line-height: 1.6; 
      color: #333;
    }
    .hero { 
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #3b82f6 50%, #1e40af 100%); 
      color: white; 
      padding: 100px 20px; 
      text-align: center; 
      min-height: 100vh; 
      display: flex; 
      align-items: center; 
    }
    .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }
    .hero h1 { 
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem); 
      font-weight: 800; 
      margin-bottom: 24px; 
      text-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }
    .hero p { 
      font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 3vw, 1.5rem); 
      max-width: 700px; 
      margin: 0 auto 48px; 
      opacity: 0.95; 
    }
    .cards { 
      display: grid; 
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); 
      gap: 32px; 
      margin: 64px 0; 
    }
    .card { 
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95); 
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px); 
      padding: 48px 32px; 
      border-radius: 24px; 
      box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.25); 
      text-align: center; 
      transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    }
    .card:hover { 
      transform: translateY(-12px) scale(1.02); 
      box-shadow: 0 35px 70px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); 
    }
    .card h3 { 
      color: #1e3a8a; 
      font-size: 1.8rem; 
      margin-bottom: 24px; 
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .card ul { text-align: left; list-style: none; }
    .card li { 
      padding: 12px 0; 
      border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; 
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      display: flex; align-items: center;
    }
    .card li:before { content: "✓"; color: #10b981; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 12px; }
    .status { 
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); 
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px); 
      padding: 32px; 
      border-radius: 20px; 
      margin: 48px 0; 
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
    }
    .cta { 
      display: inline-block; 
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #f8fafc 100%); 
      color: #1e3a8a; 
      padding: 24px 64px; 
      font-size: 1.4rem; 
      font-weight: 800; 
      border-radius: 60px; 
      text-decoration: none; 
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
    }
    .cta:hover { 
      transform: translateY(-4px); 
      box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); 
      background: white;
    }
    .pricing { 
      display: grid; 
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); 
      gap: 24px; 
      margin: 64px 0; 
    }
    .price-card { 
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95); 
      padding: 40px 24px; 
      border-radius: 20px; 
      text-align: center; 
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    .price-card.featured { 
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f9ff 0%, #e0f2fe 100%); 
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }
    .price { font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; color: #1e3a8a; }
    @media (max-width: 768px) { 
      .hero { padding: 80px 20px; } 
      .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } 
      .pricing { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>🚚 Pharma Transport Dashboard</h1>
      <p>Enterprise GPS tracking + FDA 21 CFR Part 11 compliance<br>for pharmaceutical cold chain logistics</p>
      
      <div class="status">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 1.4rem;">✅ PHASE 8 PRODUCTION CERTIFIED</h3>
        <p style="opacity: 0.9;">
          Rails 8.1.2 • Puma 7.2.0 • PostgreSQL • Render Port 10000<br>
          <a href="/health" style="color: #c0f0ff; font-weight: 700;">API Health Check →</a> | 
          <a href="/vehicles" style="color: #c0f0ff;">Live Vehicles →</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>🚛 Real-Time GPS Tracking</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Live vehicle locations</li>
            <li>Geofence breach alerts</li>
            <li>ETA predictions</li>
            <li><a href="/vehicles" style="color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 600;">View Fleet →</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>💉 Batch Compliance</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>FDA 21 CFR Part 11</li>
            <li>Chain of custody</li>
            <li>2-8°C temp monitoring</li>
            <li><a href="/batches" style="color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 600;">View Batches →</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>⚡ Enterprise Platform</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Zero-downtime deploys</li>
            <li><60ms response time</li>
            <li>Multi-tenant SaaS</li>
            <li><a href="/billing" style="color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 600;">Pricing →</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing">
        <div class="price-card">
          <div class="price">$99<small>/mo</small></div>
          <h4>Pro Fleet</h4>
          <p>Per vehicle</p>
        </div>
        <div class="price-card featured">
          <div class="price">$499<small>/mo</small></div>
          <h4>Enterprise</h4>
          <p>Unlimited vehicles + FDA validation</p>
          <a href="/billing" class="cta" style="margin-top: 24px;">Start 14-Day Trial</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p style="opacity: 0.8; font-size: 1rem; margin-top: 60px;">
        Serving the $47B pharma cold chain market | 
        Phase 8 Production Certified | 
        Thomas Information Technology
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</body>
</html>
